      "content": "thanks for the advice. i have some baby aspirin here too, like the chewable ones meant for adults but they're small. would it be okay to give him one of those along with the ibuprofen just to be sure the fever breaks? he looks so uncomfortable and i'm just worried the ibuprofen isn't strong enough on its own.",
